        'Discovered the antibacterial properties of penicillin and published his findings in 1929. His paper served as the scientific starting point for subsequent antibiotic research.',
      limitations:
        'He was unable to extract, purify, or stabilize the active penicillin compound. Believing it was too unstable to be used as anything more than a minor local antiseptic, he abandoned his research in 1931, leaving it completely undeveloped as a systemic drug.',
